  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Infrastructure Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Infrastructure Program aims to contribute to economic growth and infrastructure development in Solomon Islands. The first line of effort includes the delivery of climate resilient and accessible infrastructures including markets, roads, wharves, and the harnessing of non-fossil energy. The second line of effort is to capacitate the Solomon Islands Government to plan, finance, deliver and maintain economic infrastructure assets. All efforts are guided by alignment with Australian and Solomon Islands development priorities, and a strong focus on local content, inclusion, climate change, and safety and quality.</narrative>
  </description>
